OL,3,GNEWSAFour more charged over meth lab
OL,4,Adiscovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour more men have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the alleged production
OL,8,Fof meth from a lab in rural
OL,9,FWarwickshire after five Mexican
OL,10,Fnationals appeared in court.
OL,12,FThe men are all accused of conspiracy
OL,13,Fto produce methamphetamine - a Class A
OL,14,Fdrug that is highly addictive and can
OL,15,Flead to severe psychosis, a heart
OL,16,Fattack or a stroke.
OL,18,FThe National Crime Agency (NCA) alleges
OL,19,Fthat the men were part of a group
OL,20,Fmanufacturing the drug at a meth lab
OL,21,Fnear the hamlet of Furnace End.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
