OL,3,GNEWSAFour more charged over meth lab
OL,4,Adiscovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenneth Burton, from County Durham,
OL,7,FPaul Harkness Mawby and Anthony Devine,
OL,8,Fboth from Stockton-on-Tees, all aged
OL,9,F34, and Mohammed Khan, 36, of
OL,10,FBirmingham, were arrested on Thursday.
